Problem 2 – Convert to Parity List
Steps / Flow
Create an empty list.
Go through each number in the list.
If the number is even, add 0.
If the number is odd, add 1.
Return the new list.

START

Input nums
Create an empty list result

FOR each number in nums
    IF number MOD 2 = 0 THEN
        Add 0 to result
    ELSE
        Add 1 to result
    END IF
END FOR

Return result

STOP
